{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">趙浚承（Gary）40歲生日，一眾熱情粉絲特意為他舉辦溫馨生日會熱烈慶祝。處境劇《愛·回家之三代同糖》的一眾演員好友包括車婉婉、徐榮、關曜儁、吳若希及吳兆麟等人亦特別到場祝賀，還一起收看劇集，場面非常熱鬧。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ae5f9f31-d7e9-46e1-8d68-90d70f31d5b9.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026G4cy1qVZWS1789375675.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ae5f9f31-d7e9-46e1-8d68-90d70f31d5b9.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">派對現場佈置得十分用心，除了有亮眼燈牌，更準備了印有「GARY 40」字樣的精美歌唱主題蛋糕。車婉婉在現場更一度感性落淚，與壽星公趙浚承深情擁抱。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ead06c87-8c0c-423f-ba1f-35159f5acf67.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20267RLzIsv3aI1789375674.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ead06c87-8c0c-423f-ba1f-35159f5acf67.png.webp\"/></div></div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">而趙浚承亦展現歌喉，與吳兆麟一同合唱《櫻花樹下》，將現場氣氛推向高潮。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T09:18:51.104143+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}